  "body": "OPEN HOME | SATURDAY | SUNDAY 11:45 - 12:15\r\n\r\nNEW LISTING | A bold architectural statement | A compelling opportunity.\r\n\r\nSome homes are built to impress. Others are built to stand apart. 52 Beach Road does both.\r\n\r\nThis exceptional coastal residence returns to the market with a fresh price perspective and an opportunity that deserves serious consideration.\r\n\r\nArchitecturally designed by Richard Furze, this remarkable residence combines striking architecture with uncompromising substance. Reinforced concrete and steel construction, premium New Zealand made Nu Wall aluminium cladding and approximately 446sqm of beautifully considered interiors create a home of genuine presence, complemented by incredible ocean views and a stunning outlook towards Rangitoto Island.\r\n\r\nThoughtfully designed to balance relaxed family living, the interiors showcase engineered timber flooring by Forté, luxurious New Zealand wool carpet by Bremworth and refined finishes throughout. The beautifully appointed bathrooms take inspiration from the surrounding coastal landscape, reflecting the natural tones and textures of the nearby cliffs.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the home sits an award winning designer kitchen, Highly Commended at the 2026 TIDA Designer Kitchen Awards, recognised for its exceptional craftsmanship, luxurious aesthetic and thoughtful functionality.\r\n\r\nEntertaining is taken to another level with a private cinema, dedicated wine cellar and expansive entertainment area featuring a custom bar. Oversized ranch sliders open seamlessly to the outdoor decks and swimming pool, creating an exceptional connection between indoor and outdoor living.\r\n\r\nWith all floors connected by lift, this substantial residence delivers an impressive balance of luxury, privacy and effortless everyday living.\r\n\r\nTHE DETAILS MAKE THE DIFFERENCE.\r\n• Five bedrooms, multiple living areas and a dedicated home office or gym.\r\n• Double internal garaging, plus two additional off-street car parks.\r\n• Award winning designer kitchen, Highly Commended at the 2026 TIDA Designer Kitchen Awards.\r\n• Premium interior finishes, including Forté engineered timber flooring and Bremworth New Zealand wool carpet.\r\n• Private cinema, wine cellar and custom bar, creating exceptional spaces for entertaining.\r\n• Expansive outdoor decks, plus consent for a louvre roof.\r\n• Inground swimming pool.\r\n• Oversized ranch sliders, seamlessly connecting the indoor entertaining spaces with the poolside setting.\r\n• Mains gas fireplace and climate controlled air conditioning for year round comfort.\r\n• Reinforced concrete and steel construction, complemented by premium New Zealand made Nu-Wall aluminium cladding.\r\n• Lift access to all four levels, delivering convenience and ease of living.\r\n• Spectacular coastal views, including an outlook towards Rangitoto Island.\r\n• Zoned for Campbells Bay Primary, Murrays Bay Intermediate and both Westlake Boys’ and Girls’ High Schools. \r\n\r\nA NEW CHAPTER. A NEW PRICE. YOUR OPPORTUNITY.\r\n\r\nWe welcome all conjunctional enquiries!\r\n\r\nContact Matt or Nicky to arrange your private viewing, or check out open home times.",
